[node name="OrderBook" type="Area2D" parent="Furniture"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(280, -200)
script = ExtResource("10_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read Order Book"
flag_to_set = "bulk_orders_found"
discovery_text = "[b]Bjorn's order book[/b]

A soot-stained book lies open beside the workbench. Most entries are horseshoes, hinges and plough blades, but one customer stands out. Gregor has ordered swords and spearheads every few weeks for months, far more than a village shop could ever sell, and with them things no shop sells at all: pick-heads by the dozen, and chain, 'drawn even, good links, shackle ends'.

Each order is paid in full and marked 'collected at night'."
reexamine_text = "Gregor's orders fill page after page: blades, pick-heads, chain with shackle ends. Where could it all be going?"

