[node name="BjornsScale" type="Area2D" parent="Furniture"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(40, -150)
script = ExtResource("10_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at Bjorn's scale"
flag_to_set = ""
puzzle_id = "weigh_the_tiles"
discovery_text = "[b]Bjorn's scale[/b]

A brass beam scale by the anvil, with a nest of iron weights down to the quarter-ounce. Set a tile on one pan and the weights on the other, and the beam tells you what the tile weighs.

Every tile poured from the urn brings the beam level at two ounces and a half. Lay the two ELENA tiles one to each pan, and the beam does not hang level."
reexamine_text = "Bjorn's beam scale. Every tile from the urn weighs two ounces and a half; the two ELENA tiles do not balance each other."

